-- ¶6: the joint committee set up under the memorandum of 13.5.99 goes on;
-- from 31.01.01 (handwritten) its task is to examine changing the update
-- mechanism of the budgetary pensions to linkage to the consumer price
-- index, or another agreed mechanism. The memorandum is outside the corpus.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p6
`the joint committee's task starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 1 2001

`why the memorandum of 13.5.99 is not in the 2001 framework` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "מזכר ההבנה מיום 13.5.99 וההסכם הקיבוצי (מסגרת) מיום 13.5.99"

-- ¶7: the findings on the erosion of the pensions against the active
-- employees in October 1997–December 1999, and the compensation of the
-- pensioners who retired by 31.12.99 (subject to a law), are no precedent
-- for the committee or for any claim on the pensions after December 1999.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p7
`the erosion compensation is a precedent for the pensions after 1999` MEANS FALSE

