GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the letter of 31.1.2001 exhausts the erosion claim` `retired on` `the claim is for` IF
        `retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1999)
    AND `the claim is for` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1999)

-- ¶4: the commissioner asks for written confirmation; attachments ¶15: the
-- chair confirms what the letter says.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_4 akn:attachments/p15
`confirming the letter of 31.1.2001` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    MUST  `confirm the commissioner's letter of 31.1.2001 in writing`

`the Histadrut confirmed the letter of 31.1.2001` MEANS TRUE

